  id: cable_24pin
  displayName: 24-pin ATX Power Cable
  category: 8
  icon: {fileID: 0}
  mlLabel: cable
  mlAliases: []
  specChips:
  - ATX 24-pin
  - Latching
  shortDescription: Carries main power from the PSU to the motherboard.
  whatItDoes: The 24-pin cable supplies the motherboard's main voltages. Its keyed
    pins and latch make sure it only fits one way and stays in place.
  keyFacts:
  - Only fits one way
  - Press until the latch clicks
  - Separate from the CPU EPS 8-pin cable
  installationSteps:
  - Line up the latch with the tab on the header.
  - Push straight in until it clicks.
  - Tug gently to check it's locked.
  safetyTip: "Never force a connector \u2014 if it doesn't fit, check the orientation."
  model3DPrefab: {fileID: 7855445402592839051, guid: a8c7e6764c290234fb758986ad701f9a, type: 3}
